We’re Dodo Pizza. We’re in love with two things: Pizza and Tech. So, we’ve found a way to make the best pizza, make it affordable, and deliver fast.

All our pizzas have crunchy dough, we use fresh vegetables, creamy mozzarella, and a special sauce made from Italian tomatoes and spices. We are fans of quality, cleanliness, and safety and we have nothing to hide!

You can:

— combine pizza halves;

— tailor the recipe according to your preference;

— store the order history and delivery addresses;

— collect a cashback for each order.

Our first pizzeria opened in 2011, now we have over 950 stores in 18 countries such as Vietnam, Nigeria, the United Arab Emirates, Estonia, and a host of other countries. Try us! Download the App and order now.

Please send your suggestions and questions to mobile@dodopizza.com

HURACÁN COFFEE app works as digital loyalty program card where: 
- You collect 10% from purchases, unless on marked items; 
- You see exact amount of collected points; 
- You find the nearest HURACÁN COFFEE café; 
- You receive HURACÁN COFFEE new arrivals and special offers.

You already have HURACÁN COFFEE loyalty card? Download this app, install it and register your loyalty card - all your points will be automatically transfered to the mobile app. IMPORTANT - once you transfer your points from physical card to the app, you will not be able to use your physicall card. Questions and suggestions - info@huracan.lt

Entra nel mondo wagamama e scopri i vantaggi a te dedicati!

Con la nuova APP potrai accedere dal tuo smartphone a tutti i servizi esclusivi riservati agli amanti di Wagamama.

Per iniziare registrati ed accedi subito al tuo programma fedeltà personalizzato.

Attraverso la nostra applicazione potrai:
- accedere in ogni momento alla tua card virtuale ed ottenere sconti e promozioni a te riservati;
- rimanere sempre aggiornato sullo stato del tuo profilo;
- attivare una convezione aziendale;
- prenotare il tavolo nel tuo ristorante preferito;
- trovare lo store a te più vicino, ed essere informato su orari di apertura e servizi;
- ordinare i tuoi piatti preferiti da gustare direttamente a casa tua;

Scarica l'APP e scopri il programma personalizzato dedicato alle tue esigenze!
